msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_556C1399_D7A0_4B38_A6DB_6946491A8160"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫I apologize for making you listen to my dreadful stories for so long. "
"⟪k:38⟫You must be quite weary of them by now."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫Peço desculpas por fazer você ouvir minhas medonhas histórias por tanto "
"tempo. ⟪k:38⟫Deve estar bastante cansado delas agora."

#: scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: efef1566dfd9c3761915f97d54010adb4efb6c1c6a7ec97983f8ee195de35328
#. default-sha256: a3b892dadfea9df4759fe9bf3904873595e184cb911670b72d44125f54ba878e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_22E7D063_B796_4594_A606_5DBD3B193E2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But worry not, for this is the final one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas não se preocupe, pois esta é a última."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd1bef1e403b45ba8c854cf89a76b1c548b8d51b01603df6e1b8ba9647840a9b
#. default-sha256: 12bc6bb34e84b397682d933a9fd012ed509f2f04a33a3f60ccc42239bd80959d
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5FFD9067_E11D_4279_AA9B_4F0DC72D8A27"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And despite being the end, it is neither dramatic nor exciting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E apesar de ser o fim, não é dramático nem emocionante."

#: scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cd7eca6bf216b656d2b798f5c3cb7801f6823c454ee4d64dc40108f76707c6f
#. default-sha256: f15d21560fd414c577a6f907e6541152c13194609b92a965c4d406b8707e97dd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_72F9EB16_EAA9_4710_9482_6C51B1F9FC15"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was a single phrase—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the most insignificant of things—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Foi uma única frase—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a mais insignificante das coisas—"

#: scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 567843ce78d005f3071116d661df377bad1c14a1af18e67b649950e7fda8509c
#. default-sha256: 498582a77f3edae687ffdcce8466cc096dea3b8b50c333af56fb0ec08beb9190
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_076A4C37_956A_4FC0_B6F2_2CEC0EEF1EB9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫that caused me to completely lose myself and forget I had, long ago, been the woman called "
"Giselle."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫que fez com que eu me perdesse completamente e esquecesse que eu era, há muito tempo, a "
"mulher chamada Giselle."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebafff043008eadf7a6d0b2c87e484116e937ee5ce4b7de3ea5922f4df857b0f
