msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FF896C7C_8BFE_4088_A051_EDE1EE66FF96"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫There was no malice in it. ⟪k:1⟫It was but a simple greeting."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não houve malícia nela. ⟪k:1⟫Foi apenas uma simples saudação."

#: scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 44a031a4de171ca8301ba0779a72bbfc8da390f8c81c02ac289036e07d16450e
#. default-sha256: ae3dd87fe7dfd7df811948f56b0534deff587af6fa1d9890196b089056e31651
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_53347EC4_B414_492B_993D_8757F2C0E14B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Do you remember how, the first time she arrived,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lembra-se de como, a primeira vez que ela chegou,"

#: scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e17fccba5344a98431759204b69686783185d025e01d2b21ecbe7a2bf96f32f
#. default-sha256: 4413576438e70fb4f084c7bd6634ac8860f968e048d9f62d30d95f9a8836203a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_10F6EC42_4F81_46A1_BC78_36A8A802846B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Michel” said I had a peculiar presence about me?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She felt something there between "
"us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Michel” disse que eu tinha uma presença peculiar em mim?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ela sentiu algo entre nós."

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5f1e7cf41dc6453078dad62e6a2884640ed961a4ebfad0f48ce6ba00da04bb7
#. default-sha256: 171971c0410d9e1e3d2c2c17b7e873426235fbcf27ac620bc459109663e4c145
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEA9E9B7_5E6D_4C21_8873_F2ABE720FA54"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the second time, she said something about me seemed familiar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not "
"remember why, but her soul recognized the bonds we shared."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E na segunda vez, ela disse que algo em mim parecia familiar.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ela não se lembrava o "
"motivo, mas sua alma reconhecia os laços que tínhamos."

#: scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 337ed8206e5bd01e59ff9f72502d37dcece246944501e259d77e31d74fc8c1a7
#. default-sha256: f2333d2c73757001263cbeae30608d91a846c10d50248048b198a5c20fbfecd5
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F06992C8_18FF_4B48_8EA8_D9231880549E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I assumed that the next time she showed up, she would feel something even stronger, ⟪k:1⟫"
"or perhaps even have her memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então presumi que da próxima vez que ela aparecesse, sentiria algo ainda mais forte, ⟪k:1⟫ou "
"talvez até tivesse suas memórias."

#: scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f70359cbf251070479625b166f0d925c0142349cf8272baf2f3275c0aeb4070
#. default-sha256: e87975e1969ccc092995e9204f9ed6ef91a864d3778cccac08c5a7cc39d2ff0b
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_1051D477_1775_45A0_8D7B_5C6294BD13D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite having been let down again and again, I still held on to the faintest glimmer of "
"hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Apesar de ter sido decepcionada de novo e de novo, ainda me agarrei no menor vislumbre de "
"esperança."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb5de2e748b886db3878adfd0851f908250e6514cf127ac6ee9acd5d1b43e096
#. default-sha256: 900f289aa4f5bff55956d13b98cf2431af7d91b31674b922d50dd68fea8fe566
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5D0DB885_0ECC_4ECB_9B27_6A1CF4DE51C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But when she appeared, ⟪k:1⟫she was someone else’s wife."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mas quando apareceu, ⟪k:1⟫ela era a esposa de outra pessoa."

#: scenario6:scenario6_CCAA917E_5CB3_4728_BF9E_D35A17A92BF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f163b8fc45fae3404712a3e16f3fda6188139cca975f58e821dbba169fb95c3b
