msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_03232306_DBE0_4747_B3FA_10B5730DBEB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I figured you should get to know her as soon as possible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫since you’ll be "
"spending a lot of time looking after her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Achei que você deveria conhecê-la o quanto antes,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫já que você passará "
"muito tempo cuidando dela."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D13813BA_B5BC_4EC9_A313_D3F0B67349BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4efda0aa932b2ef54b192197727501ff0a6c8ae7cae39347f32b979ddf719e0
