msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_16E316EF_B176_4919_8842_25639A4FFD25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82d5ff7a021e9dae1ad984e75782a80b883270dc6f2bda1f8ca02579acb84481
