msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_16E316EF_B176_4919_8842_25639A4FFD25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hey, get out here!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Christ, there’s not a goddamned confident bone in your "
"body, is there?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ei, venha cá!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Cristo, não há um pingo de confiança nesse seu corpo, hein?"

#: scenario6:scenario6_14684D65_8FA9_4010_953A_C2D2C8D024EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca63e06fd4f88d40c9c2fd3f3d3a6d7f9e876a78b00627c1ff8bedf1fcd35f8e
