msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, ⟪k:3⟫I-⟪k:4⟫I’m sorry... ⟪k:5⟫I’ll be right out!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, ⟪k:3⟫E-⟪k:4⟫Eu sinto muito... ⟪k:5⟫Já estou indo!"

