#: scenario6:scenario6_05C8C434_3889_4466_9C5F_9C967728EF84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf56b6b30ed4110895ed1c8d004f7d63892883bfc84cabd876d3a5e03ffadff9
